# Windbrisk Heights asks whether Bot1 attacked with three creatures this turn, a question about the declaration (CR 508.1),
# not about who controls the creatures now. Bot1 attacks with three Ornithopters on turn 5; Bot2's Old Man of the Sea, free to
# tap since turn 4, takes one before the ability is activated. Bot1 still attacked with three, so the hidden Plains is played.
[Bot1 Deck]
Windbrisk Heights
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island
Island
Plains
Island x3
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Island
Old Man of the Sea
Island x20
